Fixes from #29459:

CY_PSOC6_DT_NVIC_MUX_INSTALL( n, isr, label ) -> CY_PSOC6_DT_INST_NVIC_INSTALL( n, isr )

Improvements:

1) Use of DEVICE_DT_INST_DEFINE
2) The **intmux** and **intmux channels** were enabled by default at **dts/arm/cypress/psoc6_cm0.dtsi**. This keep simpler to user to enable an interrupt at Cortex-M0+ NVIC. The below fragment, for instance, was dropped from \<board\>.dts.
```
&intmux_ch20 {
	status = "okay";
};
```

