Well, googling that leads to https://www.mipi.org/specifications/sys-t, where the official spelling is clear: "MIPI SyS-T". (So it's a common case that in colloquial writing we use lowercase abbreviations, it more official writing (like configuration descriptions), it would be nice to follow grammatically correct writing, or it may look just like misspelling to someone not familiar with a particular abbreviation).

