The compilation error in the drivers/pwm/pwm_stm32.c :
It seems the stm32L1 soc series does not support the break function on any of its timer, so should the pwm_stm32.c include a flag on _not_ **CONFIG_SOC_SERIES_STM32L1X** too, in the pwm_stm32_init function:
```
#ifndef CONFIG_SOC_SERIES_STM32L0X
	/* enable outputs and counter */
	if (IS_TIM_BREAK_INSTANCE(cfg->timer)) {
		LL_TIM_EnableAllOutputs(cfg->timer);
	}
#endif
```

