> The code looks better. But have you tried doing some basic testing? This refers also to all other reviewers, that's why I asked all of them to re-review. Some reviews are positive from the beginning even though a lot has changed... Now you will always get a PASSED result. You can even delete the whole pytest folder with your test and it still "will pass"

